{"version":1,"title":"[BUAA OS Lab0]如何成为 Makefile 和 Shell 大神 - SamuFlore","html":"<div class=\"l_main\" data-ui-surface=\"content\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"article-banner-wrap\"><div class=\"article banner top\" style=\"--bg-url:url('https://s41.ax1x.com/2026/08/31/pniUZRK.png')\"><img class=\"lazy bg\" data-src=\"https://s41.ax1x.com/2026/08/31/pniUZRK.png\">\n  <div class=\"content\" data-text-adaptive=\"split\">\n    <div class=\"banner-mask banner-mask-top\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"banner-mask banner-mask-bottom\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n    <div class=\"top bread-nav footnote\"><div class=\"top-row\"><div class=\"left\" id=\"breadcrumb\"><a class=\"cap breadcrumb\" href=\"/\">主页</a>\n<span class=\"sep\"></span><a class=\"cap breadcrumb\" id=\"menu\" href=\"/topic/\">专栏</a><span class=\"sep\"></span><a class=\"cap breadcrumb\" id=\"proj\" href=\"/posts/9dad7cb8/\">26 操作系统</a>\n</div><div class=\"right\"><span class=\"cap reading\">2722 字 · 约 10 分钟</span></div></div><div class=\"meta-row\">\n<div class=\"flex-row preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><a class=\"author\" href=\"/author/samuflore/\">Seymiris Asakawa</a><span class=\"sep\"></span><span class=\"text created\"><time datetime=\"2026-03-18T13:21:02.000Z\">2026-03-18</time></span><span class=\"sep updated\"></span><span class=\"text updated\">更新于：<time datetime=\"2026-05-28T12:37:24.607Z\">2026-05-28</time></span></div>\n</div></div>\n    \n    <div class=\"bottom only-title\">\n      \n      <div class=\"text-area\">\n        <h1 class=\"text title\"><span>[BUAA OS Lab0]如何成为 Makefile 和 Shell 大神</span></h1>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n  </div>\n  </div></div>\n<article class=\"md-text content\"><h2 id=\"Lab0-Exam\">Lab0 Exam</h2>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin link dis-select\"><a class=\"link-card plain card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" title=\"Lab 0 Exam 题目\" href=\"../../statics/lab0exam.html\" cardlink=\"\" autofill=\"desc\"><div class=\"left\"><span class=\"title\">Lab 0 Exam 题目</span><span class=\"cap link footnote\">https://samuflore.top/statics/lab0exam</span></div><div class=\"right\"><div class=\"lazy img\" data-bg=\"https://api.iconify.design/solar:text-bold-duotone.svg?color=%237777AA\"></div></div></a></div>\n<psw>只要掌握最基础的 Makefile 语法，就已经是 Makefile 领域大神了。</psw>      \n<psw>3/23/26 编辑：我撤回上面那句话。</psw>\n<h2 id=\"Lab0-Extra\">Lab0 Extra</h2>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin link dis-select\"><a class=\"link-card plain card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" title=\"Lab 0 Extra 题目\" href=\"../../statics/lab0extra.html\" cardlink=\"\" autofill=\"desc\"><div class=\"left\"><span class=\"title\">Lab 0 Extra 题目</span><span class=\"cap link footnote\">https://samuflore.top/statics/lab0extra</span></div><div class=\"right\"><div class=\"lazy img\" data-bg=\"https://api.iconify.design/solar:text-bold-duotone.svg?color=%237777AA\"></div></div></a></div>\n<p>Extra 考察的全部是 Shell 脚本的编写，回忆中的题目是这样的：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">.</span><br><span class=\"line\">├── logs</span><br><span class=\"line\">│&nbsp;&nbsp; ├── 2025-04-06</span><br><span class=\"line\">│&nbsp;&nbsp; │&nbsp;&nbsp; ├── access.log</span><br><span class=\"line\">│&nbsp;&nbsp; │&nbsp;&nbsp; └── error.log</span><br><span class=\"line\">│&nbsp;&nbsp; ├── 2025-04-15</span><br><span class=\"line\">│&nbsp;&nbsp; │&nbsp;&nbsp; ├── access.log</span><br><span class=\"line\">│&nbsp;&nbsp; │&nbsp;&nbsp; └── error.log</span><br><span class=\"line\">│&nbsp;&nbsp; ├── 2025-05-18</span><br><span class=\"line\">│&nbsp;&nbsp; │&nbsp;&nbsp; ├── access.log</span><br><span class=\"line\">│&nbsp;&nbsp; │&nbsp;&nbsp; └── error.log</span><br><span class=\"line\">│&nbsp;&nbsp; ├── 2025-06-14</span><br><span class=\"line\">│&nbsp;&nbsp; │&nbsp;&nbsp; ├── access.log</span><br><span class=\"line\">│&nbsp;&nbsp; │&nbsp;&nbsp; └── error.log</span><br><span class=\"line\">│&nbsp;&nbsp; ├── ......</span><br><span class=\"line\">└── out</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>每个日期下的 <code>access.log</code> 是该日期全部的访问记录，格式大概是 <code>&lt;IP 地址&gt; - - &lt;剩余内容&gt;</code>。</p>\n<p>每个日期下的 <code>error.log</code> 是该日期的全部报错，格式大概是 <code>内容</code>。</p>\n<blur>真的就是内容格式不重要，绝对不是我忘记具体格式了 www</blur>\n<blur>你知道的太多了。</blur>\n<p>现在需要实现一个 <code>analyze.sh</code>，指令输入格式是 <code>bash analyze.sh &lt;date&gt;</code>，用来分析某个日期的记录和报错。</p>\n<ol>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p>如果没有输入日期，那么输出 <code>analyze.sh: No date provided</code> 并结束脚本。</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p>如果输入了，那么创建 <code>reports</code> 目录。对于本题中全部<u>新建的目录</u>，请给 <code>rwxrwxr-x</code> 权限；对于本题中全部<u>新建的文件</u>，请给 <code>rw-rw-r--</code> 权限。</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p>在输入日期对应的报错信息中匹配 <code>ERROR</code> 字符串，也就是在 <code>${date}/error.log</code> 中匹配。如果不为空串，在 <code>reports/${date}/</code> 下创建 <code>error.log</code> 文件，并把匹配到的行输出到这个文件中， <strong>否则不要创建文件</strong>。</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p>在输入日期对应的访问记录中替换全部的 <code>/127.0.0.1</code> 为 <code>/localhost</code>，并将替换完毕后的全文输出到 <code>reports/${date}/access.log</code>。</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p>统计访问记录中所有 IP 的访问次数，从高到低排序并写入 <code>reports/${date}/summary.txt</code>，每行格式为 <code>&lt;IP 地址&gt; 访问次数</code>。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>一眼扫过去，这难点真是不少。首先是第三点如何判断字符串非空，然后是第四点 <code>sed</code> 替换的时候正则表达式如何写，再是第五点排序和统计。幸好，题目还给了一些提示：</p>\n<ol>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p><code>sort</code> 指令：从标准输入/文件输入中获取内容并排序后输出</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-4\">\n<p><code>-n</code>：使用数值排序而非字典序排序</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-4\">\n<p><code>-r</code>：反转排序结果</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p><code>uniq</code> 指令：从标准输入/文件输入中统计<u>相邻且一样</u>的行，将其合并后输出</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-4\">\n<p><code>-c</code> 在开头显示重复次数，格式 <code>&lt;count&gt; &lt;内容&gt;</code></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p><code>sed</code> 的正则表达式中可以用 <code>\\</code> 来转义字符，比如<code>\\/</code> 来匹配 <code>/</code>，<code>\\.</code> 来匹配 <code>.</code>。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>还有一些提示，对于这道题来说用处不大。<psw>同时我也忘了。</psw></p>\n<p>我们可以按照这样的框架来写：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><figcaption><span>analyze.sh</span></figcaption><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">if</span> [[ condition ]]</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">then</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># something</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">else</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># something</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">fi</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>首先判断是否输入了日期，没有的话直接跳出 <code>if</code> 即可，如果有，就创建 <code>report</code> 并给权限，与此同时把所有可能用到的路径都定义一遍：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><figcaption><span>analyze.sh</span></figcaption><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#！ /bin/bash</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 不要忘记写 Shebang 喔</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">LOG_DIR=<span class=\"string\">\"logs\"</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">REPORT_DIR=<span class=\"string\">\"reports\"</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">if</span> [[ <span class=\"variable\">$#</span> -lt 1 ]]</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">then</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">\"analyze.sh: No date provided\"</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">else</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">   \t<span class=\"built_in\">mkdir</span> <span class=\"variable\">${REPORT_DIR}</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">chmod</span> 775 <span class=\"variable\">${REPORT_DIR}</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    DATE=<span class=\"variable\">$1</span>\t</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">mkdir</span> <span class=\"variable\">${REPORT_DIR}</span>/<span class=\"variable\">${DATE}</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">chmod</span> 775 <span class=\"variable\">${REPORT_DIR}</span>/<span class=\"variable\">${DATE}</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    ERR_SRC=./<span class=\"variable\">${LOG_DIR}</span>/<span class=\"variable\">${DATE}</span>/error.log</span><br><span class=\"line\">    ACCESS_SRC=./<span class=\"variable\">${LOG_DIR}</span>/<span class=\"variable\">${DATE}</span>/access.log</span><br><span class=\"line\">    ERR_DST=./<span class=\"variable\">${REPORT_DIR}</span>/<span class=\"variable\">${DATE}</span>/error.log</span><br><span class=\"line\">    ACCESS_DST=./<span class=\"variable\">${REPORT_DIR}</span>/<span class=\"variable\">${DATE}</span>/access.log</span><br><span class=\"line\">    SUM_DST=./<span class=\"variable\">${REPORT_DIR}</span>/<span class=\"variable\">${DATE}</span>/summary.txt</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># something</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">fi</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>把各种路径先定义好，方便后面使用，也方便修改。但是注意不要提前创建文件，毕竟有可能不需要创建。</p>\n<p>接下来是第三点。我们可以先拿一个变量把匹配到的内容装起来，然后判断这个变量是不是空的：如果不是空的，执行 <code>if</code> 块的内容；否则什么也不做。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><figcaption><span>analyze.sh</span></figcaption><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">if</span> [[ <span class=\"variable\">$#</span> -lt 1 ]]</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">then</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">\"analyze.sh: No date provided\"</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">else</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># something</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    err=$(grep <span class=\"string\">\"ERROR\"</span> <span class=\"variable\">${ERR_SRC}</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> [[ <span class=\"variable\">${err}</span> ]] <span class=\"comment\"># 这是一个小技巧，用来判断是否为空串</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">then</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"built_in\">touch</span> <span class=\"variable\">${ERR_DST}</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"built_in\">chmod</span> 664 <span class=\"variable\">${ERR_DST}</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        grep <span class=\"string\">\"ERROR\"</span> <span class=\"variable\">${ERR_SRC}</span> | <span class=\"built_in\">cat</span> &gt; <span class=\"variable\">${ERR_DST}</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">fi</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># something</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">fi</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin colorful note\" color=\"red\"><div class=\"title\"><strong><p>注意</p>\n</strong></div><div class=\"body\"><p>你不可以用 <code>echo</code> 来把 <code>err</code> 写入 <code>${ERR_DST}</code>。它会吞掉所有换行符，导致匹配的结果都在一行内输出！</p></div></div>\n<p>接下来是第四点。只需要注意用反斜杠转义字符就可以了：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><figcaption><span>analyze.sh</span></figcaption><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">if</span> [[ <span class=\"variable\">$#</span> -lt 1 ]]</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">then</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">\"analyze.sh: No date provided\"</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">else</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># something</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">touch</span> <span class=\"variable\">${ACCESS_DST}</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">chmod</span> 664 <span class=\"variable\">${ACCESS_DST}</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    sed   <span class=\"string\">\"s/\\/127\\.0\\.0\\.1/\\/localhost/g\"</span> <span class=\"variable\">${ACCESS_SRC}</span> | <span class=\"built_in\">cat</span> &gt; <span class=\"variable\">${ACCESS_DST}</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># something</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">fi</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin colorful note\"><div class=\"title\">提示</div><div class=\"body\"><p>还记得要给权限吗？</p></div></div>\n<p>最后就是大魔王第五点，又要统计又要排序，看着都烦。但箭在弦上，不得不发，还是一步一步看吧：</p>\n<ol>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p>要想统计各 IP 出现次数，我们只能依靠提示中的 <code>uniq</code> 指令，它可以将重复次数显示在每行开头，但是要求重复的行必须紧靠在一起。</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p>要想让重复的行紧靠在一起，我们只能依靠提示中的 <code>sort</code> 指令，它可以排序，但是原始输入中除了 IP，还有杂七杂八的内容，我们只要对 IP 进行排序。</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p>要想提取每行的 IP，我们可以用 <code>awk</code> 指令，因为 IP 和后面的内容中间都是用 <code>- -</code> 分割的。</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p>输出是重复次数在后，而 <code>uniq</code> 展示的是重复次数在前，需要换个位置。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这样，第五点是不是就清楚多了，我们只需要一步一步来，每轮处理后的结果都用管道给到下一轮，最后的结果写入文件，就可以了。<br>\n首先我们用 <code>awk</code> 把 IP 提出来：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><figcaption><span>analyze.sh</span></figcaption><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">awk -F<span class=\"string\">\"- -\"</span> <span class=\"string\">'{print $1}'</span> <span class=\"variable\">${ACCESS_DST}</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin colorful note\"><div class=\"title\">提示</div><div class=\"body\"><p>注意 <code>{print $1}</code> 外不能用双引号包裹喔。</p></div></div>\n<p>这样就提取了每行的 IP，接下来给它排个序，让完全相同的 IP 靠在一起：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><figcaption><span>analyze.sh</span></figcaption><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">awk -F<span class=\"string\">\"- -\"</span> <span class=\"string\">'{print $1}'</span> <span class=\"variable\">${ACCESS_DST}</span> | <span class=\"built_in\">sort</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>然后用 <code>uniq</code> 统计重复次数，记得输出重复次数到行首：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><figcaption><span>analyze.sh</span></figcaption><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">awk -F<span class=\"string\">\"- -\"</span> <span class=\"string\">'{print $1}'</span> <span class=\"variable\">${ACCESS_DST}</span> | <span class=\"built_in\">sort</span> | <span class=\"built_in\">uniq</span> -c</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>这时候输出的样子就好像是：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1 192.168.0.1</span><br><span class=\"line\">10 127.0.0.1</span><br><span class=\"line\">......</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>我们得再排个序，让次数多的放上面：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><figcaption><span>analyze.sh</span></figcaption><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">awk -F<span class=\"string\">\"- -\"</span> <span class=\"string\">'{print $1}'</span> <span class=\"variable\">${ACCESS_DST}</span> | <span class=\"built_in\">sort</span> | <span class=\"built_in\">uniq</span> -c | <span class=\"built_in\">sort</span> -n -r</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>这里用数值排序，并反转顺序。</p>\n<p>到这里，离最后的胜利就只有一步之遥了：把 IP 放前面，次数放后面。好消息是它们天然就用空格分开了，我们直接用 <code>awk</code> 就解决了：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><figcaption><span>analyze.sh</span></figcaption><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">awk -F<span class=\"string\">\"- -\"</span> <span class=\"string\">'{print $1}'</span> <span class=\"variable\">${ACCESS_DST}</span> | <span class=\"built_in\">sort</span> | <span class=\"built_in\">uniq</span> -c | <span class=\"built_in\">sort</span> -n -r | awk <span class=\"string\">'{print $2,$1}'</span> | <span class=\"built_in\">cat</span> &gt; <span class=\"variable\">${SUM_DST}</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>最后贴一下完整代码：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><figcaption><span>analyze.sh</span></figcaption><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">#!/bin/bash</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">LOG_DIR=<span class=\"string\">\"logs\"</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">REPORT_DIR=<span class=\"string\">\"reports\"</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">if</span> [[ <span class=\"variable\">$#</span> -lt 1 ]]</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">then</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">\t<span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">\"analyze.sh: No date provided\"</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">else</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">\t<span class=\"built_in\">mkdir</span> <span class=\"variable\">${REPORT_DIR}</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">\t<span class=\"built_in\">chmod</span> 775 <span class=\"variable\">${REPORT_DIR}</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">\tDATE=<span class=\"variable\">$1</span>\t</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t<span class=\"built_in\">mkdir</span> <span class=\"variable\">${REPORT_DIR}</span>/<span class=\"variable\">${DATE}</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">\t<span class=\"built_in\">chmod</span> 775 <span class=\"variable\">${REPORT_DIR}</span>/<span class=\"variable\">${DATE}</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">\tERR_SRC=./<span class=\"variable\">${LOG_DIR}</span>/<span class=\"variable\">${DATE}</span>/error.log</span><br><span class=\"line\">\tACCESS_SRC=./<span class=\"variable\">${LOG_DIR}</span>/<span class=\"variable\">${DATE}</span>/access.log</span><br><span class=\"line\">\tERR_DST=./<span class=\"variable\">${REPORT_DIR}</span>/<span class=\"variable\">${DATE}</span>/error.log</span><br><span class=\"line\">\tACCESS_DST=./<span class=\"variable\">${REPORT_DIR}</span>/<span class=\"variable\">${DATE}</span>/access.log</span><br><span class=\"line\">\tSUM_DST=./<span class=\"variable\">${REPORT_DIR}</span>/<span class=\"variable\">${DATE}</span>/summary.txt</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t</span><br><span class=\"line\">\terr=$(grep <span class=\"string\">\"ERROR\"</span> <span class=\"variable\">${ERR_SRC}</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t<span class=\"keyword\">if</span> [[ <span class=\"variable\">${err}</span> ]]</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t<span class=\"keyword\">then</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t<span class=\"built_in\">touch</span> <span class=\"variable\">${ERR_DST}</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t<span class=\"built_in\">chmod</span> 664 <span class=\"variable\">${ERR_DST}</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\tgrep <span class=\"string\">\"ERROR\"</span> <span class=\"variable\">${ERR_SRC}</span> | <span class=\"built_in\">cat</span> &gt; <span class=\"variable\">${ERR_DST}</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">\t<span class=\"keyword\">fi</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">\t<span class=\"built_in\">touch</span> <span class=\"variable\">${ACCESS_DST}</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">\t<span class=\"built_in\">chmod</span> 664 <span class=\"variable\">${ACCESS_DST}</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">\tsed   <span class=\"string\">\"s/\\/127\\.0\\.0\\.1/\\/localhost/g\"</span> <span class=\"variable\">${ACCESS_SRC}</span> | <span class=\"built_in\">cat</span> &gt; <span class=\"variable\">${ACCESS_DST}</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">\t<span class=\"built_in\">touch</span> <span class=\"variable\">${SUM_DST}</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">\t<span class=\"built_in\">chmod</span> 664 <span class=\"variable\">${SUM_DST}</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">\tawk -F<span class=\"string\">\"- -\"</span> <span class=\"string\">'{print $1}'</span> <span class=\"variable\">${ACCESS_SRC}</span> | <span class=\"built_in\">sort</span>  | <span class=\"built_in\">uniq</span> -c | <span class=\"built_in\">sort</span> -n -r | awk <span class=\"string\">'{print $2,$1}'</span> | <span class=\"built_in\">cat</span> &gt; <span class=\"variable\">${SUM_DST}</span> </span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">fi</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin quot p\"><p class=\"content\">🎉<span class=\"text\">通过了 Lab0 Extra！</span>🎉</p></div>\n<h2 id=\"实验报告\">实验报告</h2>\n<h3 id=\"思考题\">思考题</h3>\n<h4 id=\"Thinking-0-1\">Thinking 0.1</h4>\n<p>第一次执行 <code>add</code> 前的结果是</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">位于分支 master</span><br><span class=\"line\">未跟踪的文件:</span><br><span class=\"line\">  （使用 \"git add &lt;文件&gt;...\" 以包含要提交的内容）</span><br><span class=\"line\">        README.txt</span><br><span class=\"line\">        Untracked.txt</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">提交为空，但是存在尚未跟踪的文件（使用 \"git add\" 建立跟踪）</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>而第二次是</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">位于分支 master</span><br><span class=\"line\">尚未暂存以备提交的变更：</span><br><span class=\"line\">  （使用 \"git add &lt;文件&gt;...\" 更新要提交的内容）</span><br><span class=\"line\">  （使用 \"git restore &lt;文件&gt;...\" 丢弃工作区的改动）</span><br><span class=\"line\">        修改：     README.txt</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">未跟踪的文件:</span><br><span class=\"line\">  （使用 \"git add &lt;文件&gt;...\" 以包含要提交的内容）</span><br><span class=\"line\">        Modified.txt</span><br><span class=\"line\">        Stage.txt</span><br><span class=\"line\">        Untracked.txt</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">修改尚未加入提交（使用 \"git add\" 和/或 \"git commit -a\"）</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>由于 <code>README.txt</code> 在执行 <code>add</code> 指令后被修改，其从暂存状态退回未跟踪状态，并且同时处于已修改的状态。</p>\n<h4 id=\"Thinking-0-2\">Thinking 0.2</h4>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p>add the file: <code>git add</code></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p>stage the file: <code>git add</code></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p>commit: <code>git commit</code></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"Thinking-0-3\">Thinking 0.3</h4>\n<ol>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p><code>git checkout -- print.c</code></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p><code>git reset HEAD print.c</code> 再 <code>git checkout -- print.c</code></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p><code>git reset HEAD hello.txt</code></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"Thinking-0-4\">Thinking 0.4</h4>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p>执行 <code>git reset --hard HEAD^</code> 后，提示：</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">HEAD 现在位于 9b64b7f 2</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p>执行命令 <code>git reset --hard 286265b</code> 后，提示：</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">HEAD 现在位于 286265b 1</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p>执行命令 <code>git reset --hard 0824f8e</code> 后，提示：</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">HEAD 现在位于 0824f8e 3</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"Thinking-0-5\">Thinking 0.5</h4>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p>输出 <code>first</code></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p><code>output.txt</code> 的内容是 <code>second</code></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p><code>output.txt</code> 的内容是 <code>third</code></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p><code>output.txt</code> 的内容是 <code>thirdforth</code></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"Thinking-0-6\">Thinking 0.6</h4>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><figcaption><span>command</span></figcaption><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># command</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">'echo Shell Start...'</span> | <span class=\"built_in\">cat</span> &gt;&gt; <span class=\"built_in\">test</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">'echo set a = 1'</span> | <span class=\"built_in\">cat</span> &gt;&gt; <span class=\"built_in\">test</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">'a=1'</span> | <span class=\"built_in\">cat</span> &gt;&gt; <span class=\"built_in\">test</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">'echo set b = 2'</span> | <span class=\"built_in\">cat</span> &gt;&gt; <span class=\"built_in\">test</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">'b=2'</span> | <span class=\"built_in\">cat</span> &gt;&gt; <span class=\"built_in\">test</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">'echo set c = a+b'</span> | <span class=\"built_in\">cat</span> &gt;&gt; <span class=\"built_in\">test</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">'echo c=$[$a+$b]'</span> | <span class=\"built_in\">cat</span> &gt;&gt; <span class=\"built_in\">test</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">'echo c = $c'</span> | <span class=\"built_in\">cat</span> &gt;&gt; <span class=\"built_in\">test</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">'echo save c to ./file1'</span> | <span class=\"built_in\">cat</span> &gt;&gt; <span class=\"built_in\">test</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">'echo $c&gt;file1'</span> | <span class=\"built_in\">cat</span> &gt;&gt; <span class=\"built_in\">test</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">'echo save b to ./file2'</span> | <span class=\"built_in\">cat</span> &gt;&gt; <span class=\"built_in\">test</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">'echo $b&gt;file2'</span> | <span class=\"built_in\">cat</span> &gt;&gt; <span class=\"built_in\">test</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">'echo save a to ./file3'</span> | <span class=\"built_in\">cat</span> &gt;&gt; <span class=\"built_in\">test</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">'echo $a&gt;file3'</span> | <span class=\"built_in\">cat</span> &gt;&gt; <span class=\"built_in\">test</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">'echo save file1 file2 file3 to file4'</span> | <span class=\"built_in\">cat</span> &gt;&gt; <span class=\"built_in\">test</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">'cat file1&gt;file4'</span> | <span class=\"built_in\">cat</span> &gt;&gt; <span class=\"built_in\">test</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">'cat file2&gt;&gt;file4'</span> | <span class=\"built_in\">cat</span> &gt;&gt; <span class=\"built_in\">test</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">'cat file3&gt;&gt;file4'</span> | <span class=\"built_in\">cat</span> &gt;&gt; <span class=\"built_in\">test</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">'echo save file4 to ./result'</span> | <span class=\"built_in\">cat</span> &gt;&gt; <span class=\"built_in\">test</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">'cat file4&gt;&gt;result'</span> | <span class=\"built_in\">cat</span> &gt;&gt; <span class=\"built_in\">test</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"># result</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p><code>echo echo Shell Start...</code> 与 <code>echo 'echo Shell Start...'</code> 无区别。</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p><code>echo echo $c&gt;file1</code> 与 <code>echo 'echo $c&gt;file1'</code> 有区别，前者会将 <code>echo $c</code> 代入变量值，输出重定向到 <code>file1</code>，而后者会先执行引号内的命令，再执行 <code>echo</code>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"难点分析\">难点分析</h3>\n<p>本次实验的难点在于掌握 Shell、Makefile、Vim 等工具的应用，以及掌握 Linux 的使用。Vim 的操作和快捷键比较复杂，Shell 的指令种类和语法比较多，都属于难点。</p>\n<p>另外一些难点在于运用 <code>awk</code> 等补充的指令处理字符串相关的内容。</p>\n<h3 id=\"实验体会\">实验体会</h3>\n<p>Lab0 的实验让我掌握了基本的 Linux 使用和 Git 等工具的使用，极大地丰富了我的知识面，方便了开发。Vim 十分好用，熟练之后可以很方便的编辑文本，脱离鼠标。</p>\n<h3 id=\"原创说明\">原创说明</h3>\n<p>本实验报告为原创，没有请求同学/助教/人工智能的帮助。</p>\n</article>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n</div>","bodyClass":"content","layout":"post","type":"tech","textIndent":false}